CDialogTree
{
Name=Brother Montgomerie
Portrait=!None
Should Have Voiceovers=1
Default Canceled Node Action=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 Conversation Start
Text=Thanks be to God, I knew someone would come...
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You must tell me what has happened here.
Go to node ID=20 attack
Icon=Quest Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 attack
Text=I am Brother Montgomerie. I fear I am the last survivor of Montserrat. But I don't think I'll make it much longer. I was afraid it would happen eventually. Those horrible beasts charged in here and...they took the relic.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Custom Requirement=CActionExpression
{
Action=CActionCheckForInventoryItem
{
Who to give check=$instigator
Inventory Item To Check For=Inventory/Specific Item Cans/Quest Items/Books/Sir Tomas Journal
}
}
Reply Text=I found Sir Tomas de Vilanova's journal at the gate.
Go to node ID=21 the captain
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Templar IS
Custom Requirement=CUseCannedExpressionExpression
{
Canned Expression=Dialog/Requirements/Faction/Templar IS
}
Reply Text=I am of the Temple, brother. Javier sent me.
Go to node ID=22 brother
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who are these creatures? Where did they go?
Go to node ID=40 beasts
Icon=Quest Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=40 beasts
Text=Horrible, powerful beasts. Monsters, assassins. They went...North. They seek more relics. They must not have them. 
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=Karma equalless 650
Reply Text=I seek these relics for my own power. Tell me more before death claims you!
Go to node ID=45 prophecy 2
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Fear not, I will help. I have been tasked to secure these relics.
Go to node ID=45 prophecy 2
Icon=Quest Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=21 the captain
Text=Tomas... They came from Barcelona two days before the beasts did. He would not sleep inside the wall - said a knight's place was the gate. He held it long enough for the brothers to bar the sanctuary. It bought us an hour. Carry his words to Lord Javier. The Temple should know how its knights died.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will. Who are these creatures? Where did they go?
Go to node ID=40 beasts
Icon=Quest Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=22 brother
Text=<He reaches for your hand and cannot find it.> Then it is ours to carry, and not some hireling's. Good. Tell Javier the abbey held as long as men can hold. Tell him what took it.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will. Who are these creatures? Where did they go?
Go to node ID=40 beasts
Icon=Quest Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=45 prophecy 2
Text=Listen...you must see Brother Michel on the other side of the Pyrenees. He must be told. I will mark the way on your map...the beasts must *not* get the relics...
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=How long ago did they come?
Go to node ID=60 not long

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who is this 'Brother Michel'?
Go to node ID=50 Bro michelle
Icon=Quest Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=50 Bro michelle
Text=He is a friend who will help you find the crypt. You must go. The relics must be protected. I can't.... <dies>.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=Karma equalless 650
Custom Requirement=CActionExpression
{
Action=CWasQuestEverActivatedAction
{
Quest=Levels/1 Barcelona/Quests/Calle Perdida/Go to Montserrat and seek out the Crown of Thorns
}
}
Reply Text=It's about time you perished. I want you to know before your soul departs that the relics will be mine.
